│                     WORLD MAP                            │
│                                                          │
│   ┌─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┐    │
│   │  A  │  A  │  B  │  B  │  C  │  C  │  D  │  D  │    │
│   ├─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┤    │
│   │  A  │  A  │  B  │  B  │  C  │  C  │  D  │  D  │    │
│   ├─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┤    │
│   │  E  │  E  │  F  │  F  │  G  │  G  │  H  │  H  │    │
│   ├─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┼─────┤    │
│   │  E  │  E  │  F  │  F  │  G  │  G  │  H  │  H  │    │
│   └─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┘    │
│                                                          │
│   Letters = Node ownership                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Pros:**
- More even distribution
- Finer granularity for load balancing
- Can dynamically reassign cells

**Cons:**
- Zone logic split across nodes
- More frequent cross-node communication
- Complex boundary handling

### Option C: Player-Based Sharding

Each node owns a set of players. The world is replicated, but each node only
simulates entities relevant to its players.

```
┌─────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐
│     NODE A      │     │     NODE B      │     │     NODE C      │
│                 │     │                 │     │                 │
│  Players 1-1000 │     │  Players        │     │  Players        │
│                 │     │  1001-2000      │     │  2001-3000      │
│  Simulates:     │     │                 │     │                 │
│  - Zones where  │     │  Simulates:     │     │  Simulates:     │
│    players are  │     │  - Zones where  │     │  - Zones where  │
│  - NPCs nearby  │     │    players are  │     │    players are  │
└────────┬────────┘     └────────┬────────┘     └────────┬────────┘
         │                       │                       │
         └───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┘
                                 │
                    ┌────────────┴────────────┐
                    │     STATE SYNC          │
                    │                         │
                    │  - Entity positions     │
                    │  - Combat events        │
                    │  - World changes        │
                    └─────────────────────────┘
```

**Pros:**
- Players never transfer between nodes
- Natural load balancing (players per node)
- No zone-based hotspots

**Cons:**
- High synchronization overhead
- Duplicate simulation of shared areas
- Conflict resolution complexity

